# 🚨 core#1014 - THIS FILE IS READ BY NO BUILD PATH IN THIS PROJECT.
#
# Docker reads `.dockerignore` from the CONTEXT ROOT. Neither build path roots its
# context here: the GHA build (.github/workflows/build-push-image.yml) uses
# `build-context/` one level up, and the compose build uses the monorepo root. A
# `docker build .` from this directory cannot work either - the Dockerfile's first
# COPY is `datanika/pyproject.toml`, which does not exist relative to this root.
#
# The file that IS honoured is `Dockerfile.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile.
# Edit that one. This file is kept only so the name is not free for someone to
# recreate with the same false assumption; its patterns are deliberately identical
# in intent, and deliberately not load-bearing.

.venv
.git
.claude
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
*.pyc
htmlcov
.env
.env.docker
*.egg-info
